.TH GRAVITY 2
.SH NAME
gravity \- reusable planar pairwise-gravity kernel
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B include "danby/gravity.m";
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I Gravity
computes pairwise softened Newtonian accelerations for an arbitrary number of
bodies stored as x, y, vx, vy tuples.  Each pair is accumulated with equal and
opposite force, preserving total linear momentum.  It also computes total
mechanical energy and angular momentum for diagnostics.
.SH SOURCE
.B /module/danby/gravity.m
.br
.B /appl/danby/gravity.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR orbital (2),
.IR numerics (2)
